# FX > SEL list > DLY TO REV: a new project sends none of the delay's echoes into the reverb, as every
# save from before the setting does (its slot is 0); up from the list; undo and redo carry it to the
# engine; saved, it loads as saved
wait 300
expect sound4.1.3 0
expect dlrev 0
listen
tap FX
tap SEL
turn SELECT 20
turn SELECT -1
wait 600
said DLY TO REV 0 %, 11 OF 12
turn ALGO 127
expect sound4.1.3 127
expect dlrev 1000
shot dlyrev_list.png
# undo (HOME + REC): none again, in the engine too; redo (HOME + PLAY): all
wait 600
press HOME
tap REC
release HOME
wait 100
expect sound4.1.3 0
expect dlrev 0
press HOME
tap PLAY
release HOME
wait 100
expect sound4.1.3 127
expect dlrev 1000
# half, saved: loads at half
wait 600
turn ALGO -63
expect sound4.1.3 64
expect dlrev 504
tap HOME
tap SAVE
wait 300
reboot
wait 300
expect sound4.1.3 64
expect dlrev 504
